#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0697 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a given PARAMCD for a combination of device and subject, more than one record has ABLFL equal to Y and BASETYPE is not present
#note "only one ABLFL=Y record in the group -> count == 1 -> noViolation"
dataset ADLBC class=MD-BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ABLFL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DEV01 | GLUC | Y
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DEV01 | GLUC | N
---
